17. In the facts of this case, though the charge-sheet stood filed by the police on 13.05.2024, this material fact was not placed before the DVCC as is evident from the minutes of the meeting dated 04.06.2024, wherein the DVCC has recorded that charge-sheet in the subject FIR has not been filed.
It cannot be ruled out that if the charge-sheet was placed before the DVCC it may have decided differently.
The DVCC's decision dated 04.06.2024 is, thus, factually erroneous and deserves to be set aside for failing to take into consideration the material fact of filing of charge-sheet.
